{
  "name": "ondra-drive-gap",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的缺口池与张力（手册 §5.1）：她心里那几件没弄明白的事记在这里。三源生成（模型自认不知道 / 工具查空 / 请求失败），张力按 created_at 幂等派生（base + 小时×rate − relief + 判重加压），相似度 ≥0.6 只加压不新建并保留最早措辞，闭合时连坐相似的 open 条目。唤醒四条件 tension≥80 且 energy>30 且闲置>30min 且不在 60min 冷却期；离线梦境窗口 02:00–05:00；休眠时长只补给那时已存在的缺口。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
